{"product":{"id":8476541911379,"title":"SYSTEM 4 BIO BOTANICAL VITAL CURE","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBIO BOTANICAL VITAL CURE BY SYSTEM 4\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eConditioner for thinning hair\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eConditioner that maintains the natural balance and well-being of the scalp and is suitable for all hair types. Contains a mixture of soothing and exfoliating active ingredients and a plant extract that stimulates the superficial circulation of the scalp. Regular use creates conditions for healthy hair growth. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Suitable for everyday use. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eGently exfoliates the scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCreates conditions for healthy hair growth on the scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eStimulates the microcirculation of the scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSuitable for all hair types\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eParfume free and dermatologically tested\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe tube is made of 50% recycled plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApply Vital Cure to Towel Dry Hair \u0026amp; Scalp. Leave on hair for 2-5 minutes. Leave on for 15-30 minutes as a scalp treatment. The heat increases the effect of maintenance. Rinse well.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003epH 3.5\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"Conditioner","created_at":"2023-07-19T18:34:19+03:00","ha